[George] Bestowing upon him the prestigious Earldom of Cornwall, a title traditionally reserved exclusively for royal princes, and appointing him Regent of England while Edward sailed to France to marry twelve-year-old Princess Isabella, daughter of King Philip I.

20
00:02:49.160 --> 00:02:49.400
[George] V.

