22
00:02:58.200 --> 00:03:10.120
[George] Edward ignored his beautiful child bride Isabella, spending the entire feast seated beside Gaveston, who was clad in magnificent royal imperial purple silk adorned with pearls.

23
00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:24.360
[George] Gaveston was brilliant, arrogant and reckless, openly insulting the great English earls with cutting nicknames, calling the king's cousin, the Earl of Lancaster, the Churle and the Earl of Pembroke, Joseph the Jew.

24
00:03:24.360 --> 00:03:32.680
[George] The furious barons formed a league, issuing the ordinances of 1311 to restrict royal power and banish Gaveston forever.

25
00:03:32.680 --> 00:03:35.000
