44
00:06:50.120 --> 00:06:53.320
[George] Edward's tactical generalship was disastrous.

45
00:06:53.320 --> 00:07:02.440
[George] He crammed his heavy cavalry into a narrow, water-logged gorge between the streams, where English knights were slaughtered in the mud, unable to maneuver.

46
00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:06.280
