47
00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:13.000
[George] Edward fled the field at a gallop to Dunbar, his army rooted, leaving Scotland free and independent.

48
00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:21.280
[George] The Battle of Bannockburn on June 23 and 24, 1314, was the greatest military disaster in English history.

49
