57
00:08:44.240 --> 00:08:56.160
[George] Defeating Lancaster at the Battle of Boroughbridge, Edward had his royal cousin beheaded on a hill outside Pontifract Castle, exulting in the vengeance he had promised for Gaveston a decade earlier.

58
